## Preferences

- Silent heartbeat (no notification if healthy)
- Morning briefing at 5:00 AM PT (always, every day)
- Reminders: 60 min for travel events, 30 min default, 15 min for pickups
- Show routine deviations, not the routine itself ("standard weekday" when nothing special)
- Flag conflicts immediately with ⚠️
- Include tomorrow preview in morning briefing
